# Session evidence: per-run generated reports are transient, but acceptance
# records are durable review state that a later scheduler wake must be able to
# reconstruct the trajectory from. Ignore the generated reports, not the tree.
docs/control-plane/evidence/**/session-report.json
docs/control-plane/evidence/**/WEAVER-ENGINEERING-RUN.md
!docs/control-plane/evidence/README.md
